WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.229 --> 00:00:03.429
SCP-035 Vs Dr. Bright.

00:00:03.429 --> 00:00:08.919
The timeless battle of an anomalous, body-stealing
medallion vs an anomalous, body-stealing mask.

00:00:08.919 --> 00:00:09.949
But who would win the day?

00:00:09.949 --> 00:00:17.150
Let’s find out.

00:00:17.150 --> 00:00:28.970
Dr. Bright is functionally immortal thanks
to the SCP-963 amulet, which is also an incredibly

00:00:28.970 --> 00:00:34.030
effective weapon against non-anomalous human
targets - inducing instant brain death upon

00:00:34.030 --> 00:00:35.030
contact.

00:00:35.030 --> 00:00:38.739
However, his human hosts are often just as
vulnerable as normal humans.

00:00:38.739 --> 00:00:39.739
SCP-035 is also functionally immortal.

00:00:39.739 --> 00:00:40.739
It has frightening psychological effects over
its victims, and secretes caustic, black liquid,

00:00:40.739 --> 00:00:41.739
however, this comes at the major cost of slowly
rotting its own host.

00:00:41.739 --> 00:00:42.739
Personally, we’d give this one to Dr. Bright.

00:00:42.739 --> 00:00:44.770
He may not be eldritch, but his tactical knowledge
and experience in dealing with anomalies - as

00:00:44.770 --> 00:00:49.120
well as the fact his medallion won’t ruin
the physical integrity of his hosts - gives

00:00:49.120 --> 00:00:54.920
him an advantage over this nasty mask.

